<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African money shortage rises to 6.658 bln rand.</title>
<headline>S.African money shortage rises to 6.658 bln rand.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's money market shortage inched higher to 6.658 billion rand on Tuesday from 6.556 billion rand on Monday, the Reserve Bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
